{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為重要日子留一個專屬位置，Dayfold 會把每個值得記住的時刻化成倒數與紀念日卡片，無論是下一趟旅程、重要生日、相識紀念日，還是重新出發的那一天，都能一眼看清還剩幾天或已經過去幾天。App 現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99，適合喜歡以視覺方式記錄計劃與回憶的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>重要日子化成倒數卡片</h2>\n<p>Dayfold 將重要日子化成倒數與紀念日卡片，可查看距離未來日期尚餘多少天，亦可回望某段回憶已過去多少天。內建 6 種卡片風格，涵蓋翻頁日曆、門票、霓虹、像素藝術與紙張排版，並支援小與中型桌面小工具。卡片可匯出為圖片分享，並以搜尋、排序、釘選與封存整理時刻。無需帳號，資料只儲存於裝置本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-324-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-325-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-326-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-327-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-328-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-329-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Dayfold: Days That Count</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:57:59.614789+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}